## Made for families

Our Family Room gives everyone space, with two double beds that sleep up to four. A fully equipped kitchenette with a Nespresso machine makes mornings easy, and the roomy en-suite has a walk-in shower so everyone can get ready without the queue. A comfortable base for a family holiday by the sea.
